data: {"id": "e678f9d7496948fa-thinking-parallel_evidence-774", "run_id": "e678f9d7496948fa", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 已采集事实与证据\n\n### ✅ 支持 VolumeMountFailed (ConfigMap not found) 的事实\n\n1. **Kubernetes Events (kubectl_describe)**：\n   - `Warning FailedMount 7m8s (x23 over 37m) MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : configmap \"unavailable-config\" not found`\n   - `Warning FailedMount 94s (x16 over 35m) Unable to attach or mount volumes: unmounted volumes=[input], unattached volumes=[input]: timed out waiting for the condition`\n   - 这两个事件分别持续了 37 分钟和 35 分钟，说明 ConfigMap 缺失问题一直存在。\n\n2. **Pod YAML (kubectl_get_ya", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1788770796131, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

