data: {"id": "e678f9d7496948fa-final", "run_id": "e678f9d7496948fa", "seq": 779, "ts_ms": 1788770814263, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-2xgjz` | ContainerCreating | Pod workload-5b5fc86c8c-2xgjz 卡在 ContainerCreating/Pending 状态，容器未启动 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | kubernetes | pod.status: Pending (fact-abc4d3b887ac) | 描述 Pod 当前的停滞状态 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | kubernetes | FailedMount: MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : configmap \"unavailable-config\" not found (fact-f25f2c97dbaf) | 直接指出根因：缺少 ConfigMap |\n| 3 | K8s Event | kubernetes | FailedMount: unmounted volumes=[input]: timed out waiting for the condition (fact-a885bc220824) | 证实挂载动作在超时 |\n| 4 | Metric | prometheus | kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason {container=\"app\", reason=\"ContainerCreating\"} = 1 (fact-dbfddef47055) | 佐证容器处于等待状态 |\n| 5 | K8s Config | kubernetes | container.resource_limit.memory=32Mi (fact-00ee60ec427a) | 排除 OOMKilled 等资源硬限制导致的状态异常 |\n\n**证据分析**：\n证据 1 确认了 Pod 的整体状态，证据 2 和 3 提供了明确的故障细节，直接关联到“input”卷的挂载失败，其核心原因是引用了不存在的 ConfigMap `unavailable-config`。证据 4 从指标维度交叉验证了容器处于 ContainerCreating 的等待阶段。证据 5 排除了内存限制导致的资源冲突。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nConfigMap 'unavailable-config' 在 namespace 'aiops-case-03' 中不存在 → Pod spec 强制挂载该卷 (Optional: false) → kubelet 挂载卷失败 (MountVolume.SetUp failed) → Pod 卡在 Pending / ContainerCreating 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认根因**：Pod 定义中引用了一个在 `aiops-case-03` 命名空间中不存在的 ConfigMap `unavailable-config`。由于该卷配置了强制挂载（即 `Optional: false`），kubelet 在启动容器前无法完成卷挂载，直接导致 `MountVolume.SetUp failed`，Pod 因此停滞在 Pending/ContainerCreating 状态。\n\n**证据支撑**：\n- `FailedMount` 事件原文（fact-f25f2c97dbaf）明确报出 `configmap \"unavailable-config\" not found`。\n- Pod 状态（fact-abc4d3b887ac）和容器等待原因（fact-4f22d17b57e6）与上述挂载失败逻辑一致。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.2m\n├─ 问题定位: 18.2s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 41.7s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-2xgjz: 41.7s (Evidence 32.8s, RCA 8.8s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 9.1s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-2xgjz**: pod-volume-mount-failed, pod-sandbox-create-failed, pod-imagepull-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 69.031, "metrics": {"run_id": "e678f9d7496948fa", "mttr": {"value": "1.2m", "seconds": 69.03533983230591, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "39%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-imagepull-failed, pod-sandbox-create-failed, pod-volume-mount-failed", "pass": true, "score": 0.85, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.09}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.06}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 0.8, "weighted_score": 0.12, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "已匹配（未识别核心）"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 69035.33983230591, "llm_calls": 15, "llm_duration_ms": 65357.68175125122, "tool_calls": 15, "executed_tool_calls": 12, "